Database Design

1. Overview

The first version of the Student Task Manager stores task information in application memory. This document describes the proposed database design for future persistent storage.

A database would allow student and task information to remain available after the application is closed.

⸻

2. Database Entities

The proposed database contains two main entities:

1. Student
2. Task

